# ===============================
# 🌐 Global Ignore Rules
# ===============================

# Node.js dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Build outputs
**/dist/
**/build/
**/dist.zip

# Environment files
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Vercel config (optional - ignore if using GitHub integration)
**/.vercel

# Log files
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# OS-generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor/IDE folders
.vscode/
.idea/

# Optional: Package manager lock files (uncomment if you want to ignore)
# **/package-lock.json
# **/yarn.lock
# **/pnpm-lock.yaml

# ===============================
# 📦 Project-Specific Ignores (optional clarity)
# ===============================

