Cosmetices-Backend/.env
Cosmetices-Backend/.vercel
Cosmetices-Backend/uploads

# Cosmetics Website
Cosmetices-Website/node_modules/
Cosmetices-Website/dist/
Cosmetices-Website/.env
Cosmetices-Website/.vercel
